# DsCard.Root docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsCard.Root size="medium">
  <DsCard.Header>
    Card Title
  </DsCard.Header>
  <DsCard.Body>
    Card content goes here
  </DsCard.Body>
</DsCard.Root>

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsCard.Root size="medium">
    <DsCard.Header>Card Title</DsCard.Header>
    <DsCard.Body>Card content goes here</DsCard.Body>
</DsCard.Root>;

